    <string name="open_meteo_https_open_meteo_com_location" formatted="false">"\n\nOpen-Meteo: https://open-meteo.com/\nLocation search: Open-Meteo / GeoNames (https://www.geonames.org/)\nData license: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/\nWeather icons: Tabler Icons · MIT\nSettings icons: Lucide · ISC / Feather MIT (https://lucide.dev/)\nUpload QR codes: Project Nayuki QR Code generator · MIT (https://www.nayuki.io/page/qr-code-generator-library)\nNetwork location: IPWhois (approximate IP location; can be changed manually)\nNews: BBC News, The Guardian, MarketWatch, Phys.org, ScienceDaily, GameSpot and The Verge. Content belongs to its respective owners and is not covered by the source-code license. Category navigation and feed interactions are inspired by NewsNow (MIT) and Read You (GPL-3.0); their app code is not included.\n\nWhen enabled, weather refreshes about every 15 minutes and news every 10 minutes. If a weather update fails or the data is more than an hour old, -- is shown. Select the weather panel to refresh it and open Xiaomi Weather. If a news update fails, recent stories remain visible and are marked as cached. Science stories are kept for 7 days, other categories for 48 hours. Science sources are interleaved and original publication times are retained.\n\n"</string>
